5:["$","section","Trust is part of the interface",{"className":"glass rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-8","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-heading text-2xl font-bold sm:text-3xl","children":"Trust is part of the interface"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-5 space-y-4 text-base leading-8 text-muted-foreground sm:text-lg","children":[["$","p","The Companion should never invent a game, feature, release date, or player history. When backend data is not connected, the interface must say so clearly rather than simulate knowledge it does not have.",{"children":"The Companion should never invent a game, feature, release date, or player history. When backend data is not connected, the interface must say so clearly rather than simulate knowledge it does not have."}],["$","p","Conversation quality also depends on variety. Suggested prompts, response structure, and recommendations should adapt to the current conversation instead of falling back to one repeated script.",{"children":"Conversation quality also depends on variety. Suggested prompts, response structure, and recommendations should adapt to the current conversation instead of falling back to one repeated script."}]]}],"$undefined"]}]
